 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Moved out of Button-up shirt: aloha shirt and kariyushi (own kind here), guayabera, Madiba shirt, barong, dashiki, vyshyvanka, huipil -> traditional-dress shelves. Moved out of Blouse: kebaya (Southeast Asian dress shelf) and tibuta (traditional shelf). Dropped as non-iconic/wholesale or unverifiable: Amrich, Ben Davis half-zip, Bouguessa, Bridge & Burn, Brutus, Kit and Ace, Margn (Synapse, Epidermis), Nicobar, POTRENDS, Horace Small uniform ranges, Sex 'Destroy' shirt (no retrieved page), duplicate Pendleton plaid board entry. Overshirt: 28 Barbour SKUs cut to 3. Gant, Kamakura and Ben Sherman models became OCBD/Vintage Ivy versions; T&A Chelsea/Belgravia/Mayfair kept as versions (Piccadilly, Richmond dropped). Not confirmed and left out: Levi's sawtooth shirt date, Wrangler shirt model numbers, Seditionaries Wikipedia page (404), Sig Zane Wikipedia (404)."
}